        "actualFrameShearArea"
      ],
      "sourceRequirementId": [
        "TRF-048"
      ],
      "sourceReference": "TRF-048 | TRAFICOM p.20 | 4.4.3",
      "evidenceExcerpt": "The section modulus of a longitudinal frame shall be calculated using Z = f_4*p*h*l^2/(4*m*sigma_y)*10^6 [cm^3] (4.9). The effective shear area shall be A = sqrt(3)*f_4*f_5*p*h*l/(2*sigma_y)*10^4 [cm^2] (4.10). The bracket shear area shall not be included in the actual frame shear area. Use f_4 = 1 - 0.2*h/s, f_5 = 2.16, p from 4.2.2, h from 4.2.1, s as fram...",
      "roleDecision": "Quantity metadata requires the canonical QUDT QuantityValue node pattern",
      "namingBasis": "Benchmark-coined descriptive engineering term",
      "namingRule": "N5 - component or subject first, followed by characteristic and qualifier/state; no unsupported external mapping",
      "nameQaStatus": "Passed - clause-anchored benchmark coinage",
      "confidence": "Medium",
      "mappingStatus": "No exact current Haitham SSP local-name match",
      "unitDecisionStatus": "Verified recommended QUDT unit from Stage 1 or a documented Stage 2 source-unit refinement",
      "range": "http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/QuantityValue",
      "unitSymbol": "cm^2",
      "recommendedUnit": "http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/CentiM2",
      "quantityKindLabel": "Area"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://w3id.org/nltl-benchmark/vocab#actualWebFrameCrossSectionalArea",
      "@type": "owl:ObjectProperty",
      "localName": "actualWebFrameCrossSectionalArea",
      "termKind": "QuantityProperty",
      "moduleName": "hull",
      "prefLabel": "Actual web-frame cross-sectional area",
      "definition": "NORMALIZED (Stage 1): candidate concept for actualShearArea derived from the linked locked requirements; scope and final semantics require vocabulary approval.",
      "alias": [
        "A_a_cm2"
      ],
